# CareerForge cache-control: 永遠 fetch 最新版
# Browser + CDN 都 no-cache，reload 直接見新 deploy
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# CRITICAL: CF Pages 自動 308 redirect `/immigration-cn.html` → `/immigration-cn`
# (extensionless). `/immigration-cn` 唔 match `/*.html` rule，所以要用 wildcard
# `/immigration*` cover extensionless paths，否則 default cache = 永久 stale。

/
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-cache
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-cache
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0

/immigration*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-cache
  Pragma: no-cache
  Expires: 0